#: {{ux|en|The settlers were attacked early next morning by a scouting '''party'''.}}
# A [[group]] of people [[gather]]ed together, especially temporarily, for a specific [[purpose]] such as [[travel]] or [[sport]]. {{defdate|from after 1387}}
#: {{ux|en|We're expecting a large '''party''' from the London office.}}
#: {{ux|en|Do you have a table available for a '''party''' of four?}}
